{"version":1,"content":"<p>迪士尼動畫《魔法師的秘密王國》（Hexed）講述性情古怪、衝動的少女比莉，發現自己擁有隱藏已久的魔法力量，並誤闖神秘未知魔法國度，可是比莉被逼與嚴格謹慎的「虎媽」愛麗斯同行，兩母女竟意外揭開家族秘密，改寫魔法世界命運。</p><p>《魔法師的秘密王國》香港定於11月28日上映。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T13:58:53.508664+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T13:20:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T21:37:58.596054+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T13:57:35.681089+00:00","content_hash":"5e88d390588d9856adc1016dd9e91c00fd1c6bcc8dd6ea7f716c0e74db519526","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}